      "updated": 1786077087051,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Authentication\nDataset Management (to manage dafarames)\nProfiling Engine (to remove insights from df every hour)\nMonitoring Engine (to monitor change in earlier data and current data)\nAgent Orchestration (Ensuring sync working of all agents)\nNotification Service (to notify if anamoly is found)\nAI Service (to explain change using AI)\nReport Service",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Authentication\nDataset Management (to manage dafarames)\nProfiling Engine (to remove insights from df every hour)\nMonitoring Engine (to monitor change in earlier data and current data)\nAgent Orchestration (Ensuring sync working of all agents)\nNotification Service (to notify if anamoly is found)\nAI Service (to explain change using AI)\nReport Service",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
